  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JLAC 2024: Enhancing the Steadfastness of Marginalized Groups in the oPt  through Legal Aid, Outreach, and Advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to enhance the resilience of vulnerable groups in the occupied Palestinian territories (oPt) by addressing human rights and fundamental freedoms for Palestinian communities facing violations of their human rights. This will be achieved through the provision of legal aid, advocacy, and community mobilization efforts. The specific objective is to protect communities, with a focus on high-risk groups such as children and women, from human rights violations. This will involve enhancing the preparedness of local communities and promoting evidence-based multi-stakeholder collaboration through advocacy and legal measures employed at local, regional, and international levels.</narrative>
  </description>
